# The exact denial each document in obsync-identity-bypasses.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both. Seven documents, seven
# denials, one arm each — so neutering any single arm turns this red rather
# than leaving the file "rejected" by the other six.
NetworkPolicy cloudflare-public/cloudflared-obsidian is outside the exact DNS, edge, and site egress allowlist
NetworkPolicy cloudflare-public/cloudflared-obsidian is outside the exact DNS, edge, and site egress allowlist
OCIRepository obsidian/obsync-chart must select the exact reviewed immutable chart digest
OCIRepository obsidian/obsync-chart must verify chart signatures against this site's exact keyless publisher identity
OCIRepository obsidian/obsync-chart must pull the canonical published chart repository
ResourceQuota obsidian/namespace-budget must be either the exact zero-Pod gate or a hash-bound reviewed namespace budget
container obsync must use the canonical image repository for namespace obsidian
